{
  "_comment": "luca_gstack 的 Codex hook 注册（真值源）。⚠️ codex 0.146.0 **不加载仓库级 hooks.json** —— 实测 .codex/ .agents/ .claude/ 三处 × (无trust / projects trust / --dangerously-bypass-hook-trust) 全组合均不触发。本文件是真值源，须并入用户级 ~/.codex/hooks.json 且授信后才会执行（断言 S11 守护）。matcher 用实测 tool_name：shell 执行=Bash、文件编辑=apply_patch（两者 tool_input 均为 command）；写成 shell 会永远匹配不上。所有 hook 经 .codex/codex-hook-adapter.mjs 调用，adapter 负责按目标 hook 分流 tool_name 别名、出向最小适配，并自带 inRepo 守卫（全局注册后只在本仓生效）。SessionStart/UserPromptSubmit 设 additionalContextLimit=0：完整直传、不截断不 spill。",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "statusMessage": "luca_gstack: 恢复 session 上下文",
            "command": "MEMORY_ROOT=/Users/luca/Desktop/luca_gstack ROUTE_GUARD_HEAVY_SKILLS=muse-loop-orchestrate node \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/.codex/codex-hook-adapter.mjs\" \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/.claude/hooks/session-restore.mjs\" 2>> /tmp/luca-gstack-hooks.log || true",
            "additionalContextLimit": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "statusMessage": "luca_gstack: 路由检查",
